#: ../../tools/mousemine_tools.rst:72 16736db7681044808da585f062df6937
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search MouseMine specifically for mouse alleles and "
"mutants. Returns allele symbols, names, MGI identifiers, allele types "
"(Targeted, Endonuclease-mediated, Spontaneous, etc.), and attribute "
"strings (Null/knockout, etc.) from Mouse Genome Informatics (MGI). Useful"
" for finding knockout/knockin alleles, spontaneous mutations, and "
"transgenic alleles for specific genes. For broader searches, use "
"MouseMine\\_search instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mousemine_tools.rst:76 d01de314e6f84c4a9a4383bf60bcaa0b
msgid ""
"``q`` (string) (required) Allele search query: gene symbol (e.g., "
"'Brca1'), allele symbol (e.g., 'Brca1<tm1Whl>'), or keyword."
msgstr ""

